<title>CROATIA: Croatia June trade gap shrinks, H1 deficit widens.</title>
<headline>Croatia June trade gap shrinks, H1 deficit widens.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA MERCHANDISE TRADE  JUNE   MAY  JAN-JUNE  JAN-JUNE 96</p>
<p> Balance (million USD)	-432  -438   -2,023     -1,393</p>
<p> Exports			   350   337    2,211	2,162</p>
<p> Imports			   782   776    4,234	3,555</p>
<p>NOTE -- January-June trade deficit widened after imports rose 19.1 percent against an export rise of only 2.3 percent from the same period of 1996.</p>
<p>-- Zagreb newsroom +385 1 455 7075</p>
</text>
